                    ( ( 1st ` ( F ` N ) ) e. RR /\
                      ( 2nd ` ( F ` N ) ) e. RR /\
                      ( 1st ` ( F ` N ) ) <_ ( 2nd ` ( F ` N ) ) ) ) $=
    ( cn cle cr cxp cin wf wcel cfv c1st c2nd cop wbr w3a wceq ffvelcdm 1st2nd2
    wa elin2d syl eqeltrrd ancom elin df-br bicomi opelxp anbi12i bitri 3bitr4i
    df-3an sylib ) CDEEFZGZAHBCISZBAJZKJZUPLJZMZUNIZUQEIZUREIZUQURDNZOZUOUPUSUN
